{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/04af099790434d2ab37214655cc65fe2.avif?t=1773365807\" width=940 height=529 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth of darkness in a Souls-like RPG. Face punishing enemies, dig up ancient secrets and Light your way through a mysterious world that challenges every decision.</strong> Explore shifty dungeons with secrets where you least expect them, redeem creatures who have fallen to darkness and use Presence \u2014 a heightened state of magical awareness \u2014 to reveal secrets that normally wouldn\u2019t see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/6bf3af92680a989a0773689c4d436303.avif?t=1773365807\" width=400 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of simply slaying corrupted foes, Amara can purify their souls through redemption. Success depends on enemy health and Amara\u2019s Light level, balancing risk and reward. Redeemed enemies regain their true form, thank her, and may leave behind loot or rare Light scrolls \u2014 adding moral choice and strategy to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/0755901c3df2c0e4a1a305b69ec22a94.avif?t=1773365807\" width=400 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a heightened magical awareness revealing hidden details in Eldoria \u2014 from traps and weakened walls to echoes of past memories. Presence can be used in combat to reveal enemy attack types and weaknesses and even granting time-slowing abilities. Strengthen the power of your Light and your Presence Abilities will rise to match it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/dfe56b5012bb0e1e6378444325b74481.avif?t=1773365807\" width=400 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/6d3abe8d9a5e8fd5aafd4e60608b509d.poster.avif?t=1773365807\" width=1084 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/6d3abe8d9a5e8fd5aafd4e60608b509d.webm?t=1773365807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/6d3abe8d9a5e8fd5aafd4e60608b509d.mp4?t=1773365807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between Magic, Melee, and Archery combat styles. Customize your build by harnessing 12 unique elements \u2014 Earth, Fire, Water, Air, Ice, Poison, Electric, Sound, Illusion, Cosmic, Light, and Dark \u2014 through spells, infused weapons, and dipped arrows. Elemental strengths and weaknesses mould every fight, so be prepared. Eldoria\u2019s creatures will not go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/959fe10aa136a36ce2a60be923991896.avif?t=1773365807\" width=400 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/5d2857d41c26d176a8cd2a57218b542d.poster.avif?t=1773365807\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/5d2857d41c26d176a8cd2a57218b542d.webm?t=1773365807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/5d2857d41c26d176a8cd2a57218b542d.mp4?t=1773365807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b2dfb8992218d171f0fb4a2db3726202.poster.avif?t=1773365807\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b2dfb8992218d171f0fb4a2db3726202.webm?t=1773365807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b2dfb8992218d171f0fb4a2db3726202.mp4?t=1773365807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through Eldoria\u2019s landscapes and dungeons filled with traps, surprise enemies, puzzles, and of course, loot! Collect weapons, spell scrolls and potions to survive on your journey. You may, also, discover the oldest truth of all, of why darkness maybe isn\u2019t as scary as it\u2019s cracked up to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-like combat with a focus on mastery, timing, and elemental strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify corrupted enemies instead of killing them through Redemption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal hidden paths, traps, and memories while in the Presence State</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch seamlessly between Magic, Melee, and Archery combat types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interconnected world filled with secrets, puzzles, traps and loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, spell scrolls, and potions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Village Consort Kevin MacLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076910?t=1773365807","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/f03adc36e9261d0c96eaeb75f014e9e0d3e2f12c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773365807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/9948f8bac36d6b204d680d854f13d7352ca1cb5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773365807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/9948f8bac36d6b204d680d854f13d7352ca1cb5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773365807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/04af099790434d2ab37214655cc65fe2.avif?t=1773365807\" width=940 height=529 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth of darkness in a Souls-like RPG. Face punishing enemies, dig up ancient secrets and Light your way through a mysterious world that challenges every 